WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.270
When it's in defense position, the 
opponent's Battle Phase is skipped!

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:15.230
Even when it doesn't attack, 
it can deal effect damage!

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.180
It's so big!

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:30.190
But just because it's big 
doesn't mean it's useful!

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.910
Too bad, but there are no 
useless monsters in my deck!

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:38.640
Due to the effect of Darksea Rescue that 
I sent to the graveyard, I draw two cards!

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.890
Then I activate Dark Flattop's effect!

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:46.890
Once a turn, I can Special Summon Flying 
Fortress SKY FIRE from my graveyard!

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.590
What?  Are you for real?

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:56.020
If he doesn't destroy Dark Flattop, 
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE is immortal.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:57.440
Resurrect!

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:59.600
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE!

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:05.880
Damn!  I worked hard to destroy 
it, but it already resurrected!

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:10.180
I activate Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's effect.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:16.040
Once a turn, I can send one card in my hand to 
the graveyard to destroy one card on your field!

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:19.060
I destroy Blackwing Armor Master!

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:20.020
Sharpshooting!

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:29.320
Then Flying Fortress SKY FIRE attacks 
Blackwing - Gale the Whirlwind!

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:31.440
Death Air Raid!

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:39.510
Crow!

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:46.500
Crow!

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.400
It seems the battle is over.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.690
You can't continue to duel in that condition.

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:53.840
Crow!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:55.430
Don't come near me!

00:01:55.430 --> 00:02:01.200
Don't come near me, Yusei!  
This duel isn't over yet!

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.270
You can still move?

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.270
Of course.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:11.970
I'm not giving up until I 
defeat the Dark Signers!

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.310
Or else…

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:22.290
Or else, they can't rest in peace!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:40.660
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:45.760
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:50.670
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:55.440
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:57.300 --> 00:03:00.800
No matter how bad today is

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:05.790
There's still the faintest light

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:11.190
All I have to do tomorrow

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:15.250
Is light it myself

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:20.260
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:25.230
Even if I get countless scars

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:31.530
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:35.510
Today will never exist again

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:41.410
So I won't stop or vanish

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:10.950
Blowing Storm
Blackwing - Silverwind the Ascendant

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:18.620
Crow…

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:23.150
I know you can still fight, Blackbird.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.220
You're saying that D-Wheel is alive?

00:04:41.150 --> 00:04:44.550
Blackbird and I haven't given up yet!

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.900
Let's restart the duel!

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.200
Fine, Crow!

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:54.620
You're angry because you lost your children.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:56.790
But I feel the same way.

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:03.880
I grew up in a poor village 
similar to Satellite.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:10.230
Just like you, I learned everything 
from Duel Monsters cards.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:15.190
I wanted to pass them on to 
my siblings and the children.

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:23.610
But now, that dream will never come true!

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:31.580
I set one card and end my turn!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:37.050
Damn!  I broke two or three ribs!

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.720
I have no strength in my body.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:41.800
But this isn't the time to complain.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:43.690
My turn!

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:50.800
Even if I summon a monster, Flying Fortress 
SKY FIRE has an effect that will destroy it.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.930
I just have to try to survive.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:58.900
If I carelessly summon a monster and take 
unnecessary damage, I won't survive this time.

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:01.820
Crow hurt himself when he fell.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.840
I end my turn!

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.860
My turn!

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:15.540
Looks like you ran out of strategies.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:17.290
You think so?

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.540
There are two set cards on my field.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:23.730
One of those cards will 
destroy all your monsters!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.670
What?

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.720
Choose carefully, Bommer.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.110
Even if he's telling the truth...

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.990
I already know how to deal with that.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.710
There's no doubt that I'll win!

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.870
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE's effect activates!

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:42.920
By sending one card in 
my hand to the graveyard,

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:46.320
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE destroys 
one card on your field!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:48.590
I'll destroy…

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:50.600
...that card!

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:54.500
Sharpshooting!

00:07:02.470 --> 00:07:04.360
You chose the wrong one!

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:09.170
If you attack me, all your 
monsters will be destroyed!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.380
I know you're bluffing.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.810
You have no monsters on your field.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:18.650
If I attack you directly, 
you'll lose the duel!

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:22.080
You're bluffing because you're desperate!

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.420
Then test me!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:27.110
With this, the duel is over!

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:30.580
Flying Fortress SKY FIRE, 
attack him directly!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:32.600
Death Air Raid!

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:35.830
I was waiting for this moment!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:37.030
I activate my trap!

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.940
Blackwing – Backlash!

00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:44.940
If I take a direct attack when there are 
five or more Blackwing monsters in my graveyard...

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:48.140
...all monsters on your field are destroyed!

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.500
What?

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:15.020
All right!  I sunk your 
fleet with just one trap!

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.240
So you weren't bluffing.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:22.210
I haven't told a lie 
since the day I was born.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:26.130
I survived because you didn't trust me.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.710
It's not that I didn't trust you.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:35.510
You're making excuses!

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:39.380
Due to the effect of Darksea Float 
that I sent to the graveyard,

00:08:39.380 --> 00:08:41.300
I draw one card from my deck.

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:45.300
I set one card.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:48.950
You stepped right into my trap.

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:51.840
I activate the trap Contaminated Earth!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:56.940
When two or more Level 5-or-above monsters 
on the field are destroyed this turn,

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:01.120
I can Special Summon an Earthbound 
Immortal from my hand, deck or graveyard!

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.020
Earthbound Immortal?

00:09:03.460 --> 00:09:05.250
Earthbound Immortal is going to appear!

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:20.830
Souls beneath the ground whose 
hatred grew over many years!

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:25.010
Emerge from the Contaminated 
Earth and lend me your power!

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:33.920
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Chacu Challhua!

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:40.660
It's huge!

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.680
It's a killer whale Earthbound 
Immortal.  Be careful, Crow!

00:09:49.900 --> 00:09:53.560
Earthbound Immortal has 
finally appeared!  My turn!

00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:58.940
He has 1800 life points.

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:04.640
I don't have a monster that can beat 
Earthbound Immortal's attack points.

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:05.580
In that case...

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.550
I summon Blackwing - Fane the Steel Chain!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:19.530
A monster with 500 attack points is 
completely useless against Earthbound Immortal!

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:22.610
This card isn't going to battle 
against Earthbound Immortal!

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.720
You're my target, Bommer!

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:28.470
This card can attack you directly!

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:29.940
Go, Fane!

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:39.360
But on the next turn, Earthbound Immortal 
will attack you and smash you to pieces!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.930
We'll see about that.

00:10:44.220 --> 00:10:45.680
What?

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:49.140
When Fane the Steel Chain successfully 
attacks you directly...

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:51.580
...one of your monsters switches to defense

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.180
position, and it can't change 
battle position next turn!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:01.330
No matter how powerful the monster, 
I'm not worried if it can't attack!

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:03.060
Well done, Crow!

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.780
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:07.900
My turn!

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:14.040
Crow, you made a huge mistake.

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:16.310
Earthbound Immortal has no weaknesses!

00:11:16.310 --> 00:11:18.160
Chacu Challhua's effect activates!

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:24.210
When this monster doesn't attack, you take 
damage equal to half its defense points!

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.220
Dark Dive Attack!

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:28.140
What?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.970
Crow!

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:40.760
I summon Darksea Rescue.

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:45.920
Then I activate the Continuous Trap Basara!

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.590
Once a turn, I can release 
one monster.  Your monster

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:54.590
that has a higher Level than my 
released monster is destroyed!

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:59.830
And the destroyed monster's controller 
takes 800 points of damage!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:04.520
I release Level 1 Darksea Rescue.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.400
I destroy Fane the Steel Chain!

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:12.360
What?

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.970
Crow will lose if he takes this damage!

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:16.610
Crow!

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:37.170
What's with this road?

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:40.440
It looks like it was bombed from the sky.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:42.640
What's happening up ahead?

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:45.820
Yusei, please be safe.

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.760
Crow will lose if he takes this damage.

00:12:54.760 --> 00:12:55.950
I won't let that happen!

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:58.420
I activate my trap Guard Mines!

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:02.940
When an effect that destroys 
my monster activates...

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:06.750
...that effect is negated, and 
you take 500 points of damage!

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.050
What?

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:18.210
He keeps avoiding my attacks!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.710
Crow!

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:20.880
My turn!

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:28.390
All I have in my hand is one trap card.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:31.860
At this rate, I'll lose.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:34.450
I'll risk everything on this draw!

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:37.860
Everyone, lend me your strength!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:49.840
Thanks, everyone!

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:54.180
I set one card and summon Blackwing 
– Blizzard the Far North!

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.220
When this card is successfully summoned,

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:04.190
I can summon one Level 4-or-below Blackwing 
monster in my graveyard in defense position!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.440
Appear, Blackwing – Shura the Blue Flame!

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:12.900
Level 2 Blizzard the Far North tunes Level 2

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:16.400
Fane the Steel Chain and 
Level 4 Shura the Blue Flame!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:23.390
Blowing storm, sublimate with 
steel will and light speed!

00:14:25.400 --> 00:14:26.880
Synchro Summon!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:30.410
Blackwing – Silverwind the Ascendant!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.020
Though you worked hard 
to get a Synchro Monster,

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:40.890
Chacu Challhua has an effect 
that skips your Battle Phase.

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.300
I see.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:46.130
But Silverwind also has an effect!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:50.900
If I choose not to battle this 
turn, I can destroy up to two

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:55.900
monsters whose defense points are 
less than Silverwind's attack points!

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:56.570
What?

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:58.610
Even if I can't defeat it in battle, I can

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:01.310
use an effect to destroy 
your Earthbound Immortal!

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:03.780
Go, Silverwind!

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:06.070
Perfect Storm!

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.010
I'm in pain!

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:08.330
Save me!

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:08.920
What?

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.100
Save me!

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.860
It hurts!

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:14.120
That's…

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:16.090
Who are they?

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:18.470
What's wrong, Crow?

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:21.430
If you're not going to attack, 
I'm going to take my turn!

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:23.600
Bommer, you don't see them?

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:26.340
The only thing I see is my goal for victory!

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:27.530
Bommer!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.340
Shut up!

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:31.650
Wait, Bommer!  Look carefully 
at that Earthbound Immortal!

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:32.570
Yusei?

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:46.450
That's impossible...

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.120
Bommer!

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:54.000
Why are people from my hometown 
inside Earthbound Immortal?

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.360
What?

00:15:56.360 --> 00:16:00.540
Those kids are your siblings?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:03.000
There's no mistake.

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:08.700
Trapped inside this Earthbound Immortal are 
my siblings and people from my hometown.

00:16:09.140 --> 00:16:15.770
That means Crimson Dragon didn't destroy 
my hometown.  It was the Dark Signers!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.710
The Dark Signers destroyed your hometown?

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:22.710
What have I been fighting for all this time?

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:28.690
Bommer, there's no point 
in continuing this duel.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.510
Stop this battle immediately!

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.940
Yusei, I'm sorry.

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:36.470
What I've done to you is-

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.240
You must fight, Bommer!

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:44.830
You're a Dark Signer who 
resurrected from the underworld!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:49.720
Battle and kill the Signers!

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:55.830
Bommer!

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:58.400
I'm a Dark Signer.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:01.670
The darkness of the underworld 
will annihilate the world!

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:03.050
Bommer?

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.160
Crow...

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.870
Hurry up and defeat me.

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:17.210
If you defeat me, the souls trapped 
inside Earthbound Immortal will be free.

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:18.540
Bommer…

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:24.190
Crow.

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:28.190
If you're not going to continue 
your turn, then I'm going.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:30.630
My turn!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.500
I switch Chacu Challhua to attack position.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.780
Be careful, Crow!

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.540
That's no longer Bommer!

00:17:41.110 --> 00:17:43.340
Earthbound Immortal Chacu Challhua!

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:44.540
Attack him directly!

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:46.580
What?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:48.790
Crow!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.900
Don't let Bommer down!

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:52.550
Bommer…

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:54.040
Oh yeah!

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:59.930
Earthbound Immortal isn't affected by my 
traps or spells, but what if it's his card effect?

00:18:00.210 --> 00:18:01.890
Die, Crow!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.680
I activate the trap Parasite Mind!

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:11.130
I take control of your Continuous 
Trap's effect and activate it!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:14.870
I'll use your Continuous Trap Basara!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:21.200
Once a turn, Basara allows me to release a

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:25.200
monster on my field to destroy 
a higher-Level monster!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:28.080
Then you take 800 points of damage!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:33.990
I release Level 8 Silverwind to destroy 
Earthbound Immortal Chacu Challhua!

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:14.060
I did it!

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:33.810
Bommer!

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:35.110
Bommer!

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:37.520
Bommer!

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:43.460
Don't die, Bommer!

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:46.150
Yusei…

00:19:47.480 --> 00:19:48.430
Crow…

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:49.800
You're safe.

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:52.450
Why did you save me?

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.040
Crow...

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.640
You saved the people in my hometown.

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.110
Bommer…

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:09.120
Make sure you rescue the children 
and raise them properly.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:12.020
I was going to do that anyway!

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:18.320
Yusei, you were right about everything.

00:20:19.270 --> 00:20:24.570
After revenge, there's nothing left.

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:26.540
Bommer…

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:32.200
Yusei, defeat the Dark Signers for me.

00:20:32.740 --> 00:20:34.470
I'm counting on you.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:41.520
Bommer!

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:45.890
Bommer, don't die!  Bommer!

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:47.890
Bommer...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:52.880
I swear that I'll fulfill our promise!

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:07.010
Sister, where are we?

00:21:08.930 --> 00:21:11.040
We've been saved!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.050
Sister!

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.430
Max!

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.520
That's a huge shooting star.

00:21:18.520 --> 00:21:21.020
It reminds me of Bommer.

00:21:21.270 --> 00:21:23.970
It was our brother who rescued us!

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:24.990
You're right.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:29.000
I wonder if our brother is also 
looking at this shooting star.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:34.450
So you're going to Kiryu's location, Yusei.

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.410
Yes.  My battle is only getting started!

00:21:57.710 --> 00:22:02.180
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:07.250
We will build our own future

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:12.690
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.150 --> 00:22:17.860
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:33.000
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:38.570
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:43.280
Even if it loses its light

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:48.550
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:53.020
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:58.600
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:03.480
This journey has no end

00:23:03.700 --> 00:23:08.940
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:14.180
Hear my voice
